        "21-hydroxylase deficiency — 95 % cases. Salt-wasting crisis 1-3 нед жизни. Hydrocortisone + fludrocortisone + NaCl supplement.",
        "## Definition + epidemiology\n\nCAH — autosomal recessive group disorders adrenal steroid synthesis.\n\n- **21-hydroxylase deficiency (CYP21A2)** — 95 % всех cases\n- **11β-hydroxylase deficiency** — 5 %\n- **3β-HSD, 17α-hydroxylase** — < 1 % each\n\n**Incidence:** 1 / 14000-18000 (classic 21-OHD).\n\n## Pathophysiology 21-OHD\n\n- ↓ Cortisol synthesis → ACTH ↑ feedback → adrenal hyperplasia\n- ↓ Aldosterone (salt-wasting form)\n- ↑ 17-OH-progesterone (substrate accumulation)\n- ↑ Androgens (shunted)\n\n## Classifications\n\n### Classic salt-wasting (75 %)\n- Severe CYP21A2 mutation\n- Cortisol + aldosterone deficiency\n- Salt-wasting crisis 1-3 нед жизни\n- Genital virilization (ambiguous genitalia girls; precocious в boys)\n\n### Classic simple-virilizing (25 %)\n- Partial enzyme activity\n- Cortisol low; aldosterone preserved\n- Virilization без salt-wasting\n\n### Non-classic (late-onset)\n- Mild deficiency\n- Onset childhood / adolescence\n- НЕ neonatal usually\n\n## Newborn screening\n\n- Расширенный screen в РФ + RUSP includes 17-OH-progesterone\n- Sensitivity ~85 % (false negatives if antenatal steroids given)\n- Confirmation: serum 17-OHP, electrolytes, ACTH stim test, genetics\n\n## Salt-wasting crisis presentation\n\n- Onset 1-3 нед жизни\n- **Vomiting**, lethargy, poor feeding\n- **Dehydration**\n- **Hyponatremia** (Na < 130)\n- **Hyperkalemia** (K > 6)\n- **Hypoglycemia** (rare)\n- **Metabolic acidosis**\n- Shock в severe untreated\n\n## Workup\n\n- **Electrolytes, glucose, ABG**\n- **17-OH-progesterone** (highly elevated в classic 21-OHD)\n- **ACTH stim test** (cortisol response)\n- **Plasma renin activity** + aldosterone\n- **Karyotype + DSD evaluation** в ambiguous genitalia\n- **Genetic CYP21A2 mutations**\n- **Pelvic US** (Müllerian structures girls)\n\n## Treatment\n\n### Acute crisis\n- **Hydrocortisone** stress dose 25 мг IV bolus, then 25-50 мг/m²/d split q6h\n- **NaCl 0.9 % bolus** 10-20 мл/кг IV если shock\n- **Glucose** D10W если hypoglycemic\n- **Hyperkalemia**: insulin/glucose, calcium gluconate, kayexalate\n- **AVOID dexamethasone** (no mineralocorticoid activity)\n\n### Maintenance\n- **Hydrocortisone** 8-15 мг/m²/d split q8-12h PO\n- **Fludrocortisone (Florinef)** 0.05-0.2 мг/d PO для salt-wasting\n- **NaCl supplementation** 1-3 g/d (или 17-34 ммоль/d) infants первый year\n- **Stress doses** (3× базовая) при febrile illness, surgery, trauma\n\n### Surgical (girls с ambiguous genitalia)\n- Genitoplasty obtained child-friendly age (currently 6-24 мес controversial; некоторые advocate later)\n\n## Long-term\n\n- Lifelong replacement therapy\n- Endocrinology follow-up\n- Adolescent growth + puberty management\n- Adrenal crisis prevention (medical alert bracelet)\n- Fertility considerations\n\n## Calculator Bordik\n- neo-hydrocortisone-dose\n- neo-newborn-screening (17-OHP timing)\n\n## Источники\n- Speiser PW et al. J Clin Endocrinol Metab 2018;103:4043\n- AAP / Pediatric Endocrine Society 2024\n- РФ Приказ МЗ 2023 (включает 17-OHP в expanded screen)",
